{"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"externalID":"s:7IvorMXL11MXLDynamicsV2idSSSgvp","title":"id","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"id","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"symbolKind":"property","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Property"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLDynamics"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The optional-unique-id attribute group allows an element to optionally specify an ID that is unique to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entire document. This attribute group is not used for a required id attribute, or for an id attribute that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"specifies an id reference."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLDynamics\/id","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"id","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Maps to the MusicXML ","type":"text"},{"code":"id","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" attribute.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxldynamics\/id"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}],"title":"IvorMXL","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","type":"topic","role":"collection"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLDynamics":{"abstract":[{"text":"Dynamics can be associated either with a note or a general musical direction. To avoid inconsistencies between","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and among the letter abbreviations for dynamics (what is sf vs. sfz, standing alone or with a trailing","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"dynamic that is not always piano), we use the actual letters as the names of these dynamic elements. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"other-dynamics element allows other dynamic marks that are not covered here. Dynamics elements may also be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"combined to create marks not covered by a single element, such as sfmp.","type":"text"}],"title":"MXLDynamics","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLDynamics","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLDynamics","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxldynamics","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLDynamics"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLDynamics/id":{"kind":"symbol","title":"id","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxldynamics\/id","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"id","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLDynamics\/id","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The optional-unique-id attribute group allows an element to optionally specify an ID that is unique to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entire document. This attribute group is not used for a required id attribute, or for an id attribute that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"specifies an id reference."}]}}}